    {
      "subId": "1201502",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Thoma and Kujou Kamaji",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "120150201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "120150201": {
            "id": "120150201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "If the Tenryou Commission won't assist in dealing with the thunderstorm, the consequences could be catastrophic.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120150202"
            ]
          },
          "120150202": {
            "id": "120150202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Kamaji",
            "text": "It's not that we're unwilling to do our part. We just don't have any spare hands right now. I hope you can understand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120150203"
            ]
          },
          "120150203": {
            "id": "120150203",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ippei",
            "text": "Exactly. So let's keep the discussion going, and see if we can find a solution.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120150204"
            ]
          },
          "120150204": {
            "id": "120150204",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, Thoma! What's going on?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120150205"
            ]
          },
          "120150205": {
            "id": "120150205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "Ah, hello you two. We were just talking about what an impact you've made in Inazuma.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120150208"
            ]
          },
          "120150208": {
            "id": "120150208",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Kujou Kamaji",
            "text": "Greetings. Thank you both again for delivering Miss Hiiragi's letter that time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120150209"
            ]
          },
          "120150209": {
            "id": "120150209",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Ippei",
            "text": "Ah, so they're friends of yours. I'm Master Kamaji's servant. Call me Ippei!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120150210"
            ]
          },
          "120150210": {
            "id": "120150210",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Sounds like you're having some trouble?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120150211"
            ]
          },
          "120150211": {
            "id": "120150211",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "Well, the Tri-Commission's work used to consist of gathering information for the Shogun and carrying out any duties she assigned.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120150212"
            ]
          },
          "120150212": {
            "id": "120150212",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "But recently, she announced that she wishes to spend some time in solitude and self-reflection. Since she is refusing to receive any visitors, there is no one to tell us what to do.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120150213"
            ]
          },
          "120150213": {
            "id": "120150213",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "We all understand if the Shogun needs some quiet time to gather her thoughts. The only problem is, in the meantime, the thunderstorm out at sea has been getting wilder.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120150214"
            ]
          },
          "120150214": {
            "id": "120150214",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I hear that storm represents the Shogun's will.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120150215"
            ]
          },
          "120150215": {
            "id": "120150215",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Thoma",
            "text": "Yup, that's the one, and in all the time it's been there, the storm has never changed in shape or size. But now, it seems to be drawing closer to Inazuma.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120150216"
            ]
          },
          "120150216": {
            "id": "120150216",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What!? So her will's changed and she wants to destroy Inazuma now? Or is this her way of trying to get revenge on us?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1201503",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the Grand Narukami Shrine and look for Yae Miko",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
